{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-06-30 13:00:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS AWARDS MORE THAN $300,000 IN SCHOLARSHIPS OVER THE NEXT THREE YEARS TO CENTRAL AND SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA STUDENTS PURSUING HIGHER EDUCATION', 'text': 'OVER 85 PERCENT OF SOCALGAS SCHOLARSHIP RECIPIENTS ARE MINORITY STUDENTS MAJORING IN STEM, ACCOUNTING AND FINANCE LOS ANGELES , JUNE 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 25 STUDENTS FROM CENTRAL AND SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA HAVE BEEN AWARDED FUNDS FROM THE 2022 SOCALGAS SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM. FOR THE FIRST TIME, THE UTILITY HAS PARTNERED WITH SCHOLARSHIP AMERICA® TO PROVIDE MULTIYEAR SCHOLARSHIPS FOR STUDENTS STUDYING SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING, MATH (STEM), ACCOUNTING OR FINANCE.'}